{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","强袭猎矛"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始后选定狩猎对象。主动使用时，投出狩猎之矛并引爆目标身上的裂伤。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始4秒后，那非选定当前累计承受伤害最高的敌人作为他的“狩猎对象”，并会优先选取“狩猎对象”作为其技能目标。\n主动释放时，那非向狩猎神祈祷，投出一根必定暴击的狩猎之矛，对目标造成600% + 70% ATK的真实伤害，并在短暂延迟后引爆目标身上的裂伤，每层裂伤额外造成35% + 3.5% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":95,"end":101,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":139,"end":146,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":91,"end":105,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":136,"end":150,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","狩猎之矛伤害提升至630% + 70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","狩猎之矛伤害提升至660% + 70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","狩猎之矛伤害提升至690% + 70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","狩猎之矛伤害提升至720% + 70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","猛利贯伤"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","投矛暴击时对目标叠加裂伤，并在目标释放大招时引爆。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当那非通过普通攻击或技能投掷长矛造成暴击时，额外造成目标6.5% + 0.8%初始最大生命值的伤害（最高不超过180% + 20% ATK），并削减等量最大生命值（首领模式下，不会削减最大生命值，但会将上述伤害转为真实伤害），最多削减40%，同时使目标获得5层裂伤，最多叠加30层，该效果不可被驱散。\n当带有裂伤的敌人释放终极技能时，每层裂伤使其受到35% + 3.5% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":60,"end":66,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":179,"end":186,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":56,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":176,"end":190,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成最大生命值伤害提升至7% + 0.8%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成最大生命值伤害提升至7.5% + 0.8%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成最大生命值伤害提升至8% + 0.8%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","眩晕厉矛"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对累计治疗量的敌人投出长矛，造成伤害和晕眩，并使其治愈降低。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对累计治疗量最高的敌人投掷长矛，造成300% + 40% ATK伤害并使其晕眩3秒，同时降低其90点治愈，持续15秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至330% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至390% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升自身暴击，叠加裂伤可进一步增加暴击。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提高24点，自身累计对敌方叠加15层裂伤后，额外提升12点暴击。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提高30点，自身累计对敌方叠加15层裂伤后，额外提升15点暴击。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提高36点，自身累计对敌方叠加15层裂伤后，额外提升18点暴击。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","索敌碎击"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","友方角色对狩猎对象造成伤害时也会叠加裂伤。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","那非的“狩猎对象”抗暴击降低16点，并且当其他友方角色对“狩猎对象”造成暴击时，也会对其叠加1层裂伤，每名友军每秒最多通过此种方式叠加1层。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“狩猎对象”的抗暴击降低24点。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“狩猎对象”身上的裂伤不低于15层时，受愈降低50点，受到伤害增加12%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“狩猎对象”的抗暴击降低32点。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","造成暴击时，提升此次伤害的暴击增幅。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当那非造成暴击伤害时，自身每1%的暴击率会使本次伤害额外提高0.8点暴击增幅。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","追踪投矛"]]}